            <ArticleTitle>Epidemiology and impact of headache: an overview.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>237-41, v</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Headache is one of the most common presenting complaints of patients in the practice of medicine. Frequently a symptom of numerous diseases, and frustratingly, the principle symptom of the primary headache syndromes, headache is experienced by 90% of the general population at some point in life.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
